    "Tap the orb to start": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touche l’orbe pour commencer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the orb to talk": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touche l’orbe pour parler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the orb to talk, and again when you are done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touche l’orbe pour parler, puis encore une fois quand tu as fini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to stop Maé": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touche pour arrêter Maé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to talk": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touche pour parler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation paused after a silence. Tap “Talk” to go on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La conversation s’est mise en pause après un silence. Touche « Parler » pour continuer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first launch can take a minute or two.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le premier lancement peut prendre une à deux minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réflexion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code is no longer valid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce code n’est plus valable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To talk to Maé again, you will have to scan a new code shown on your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour reparler à Maé, il faudra scanner un nouveau code affiché sur ton Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To talk to Maé, OpenMaé needs the microphone. You can allow it in the Settings app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour parler à Maé, OpenMaé a besoin du micro. Tu peux l’autoriser dans l’app Réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réessayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn the microphone back on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rallumer le micro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voix"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Way of talking": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Façon de parler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you say goes encrypted to your Mac, and nowhere else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que tu dis part chiffré vers ton Mac, et nulle part ailleurs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When plugged in, this iPad stays on and linked to your Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Branché, cet iPad reste allumé et relié à ton Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oui"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac does not answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton Mac ne répond pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac has turned off its microphone and speakers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton Mac a coupé son micro et ses haut-parleurs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac is reachable at home only": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton Mac n’est joignable qu’à la maison"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac no longer knows this device. To add it again, open Settings › iPhone and iPad on your Mac, then “Add a device”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton Mac ne connaît plus cet appareil. Pour le rajouter, ouvre Réglages › iPhone et iPad sur ton Mac, puis « Ajouter un appareil »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own relay": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton propre relais"
          }
        }
      }
    },
